{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/599818-in-need-of-assistance","id":599818,"title":"in need of assistance","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-22T14:21:46-07:00","id":599818,"title":"in need of assistance","content":"HI<br /> <br /> I'm a long time WW/Onyx path fan (1st edition Vampire The Masquerade ring any bells)<br /> Favorite game in the Universe is Mage The Ascension<br /> <br /> beside the point<br /> <br /> I've got a kind of itch to write/run a near future scifi game and obviously Trinity came to mind<br /> <br /> so I have a question or two<br /> <br /> what system is being used for the new trinity?<br /> and<br /> Are there going to be a lot of story changes cause if not a massive amount I could start sketching things out using my old rules?<br /> <br /> Thanks for your time<br /> <br /> Jules","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7022-maedhros","name":"maedhros","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-22T16:00:58-07:00","id":599899,"title":"","content":"Hello, welcome aboard!<br /> <br /> 1: A new system (currently nicknamed Sardonyx) is currently in development or the new <b>Trinity</b> line and also the second edition of <b>Scion</b>. It has some basic roots in common with Storyteller and Storytelling (Attributes and Abilities, rolling d10s for each dot you have) but aimed at a more action narrative. We've had some teaser posts <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/category/worlds/trinitycontinuum/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> 2: The posts also address some of the changes from the Trinity Universe (Storyteller System) to the Trinity Continuum. The 2120s of <b>Aeon</b> will feature some substantial differences, but should feel familiar to fans of the previous version.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-25T20:58:31-07:00","id":603446,"title":"","content":"Hopefully not too different.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-26T09:47:53-07:00","id":603902,"title":"","content":"All of that said, the new set-up seems to touch a bit on the potential, if not idea, of parallel timelines/realities, meaning that no matter how great the degree of deviation of whatever you have in mind, it will still be quite possible to go your own merry way or to mine stuff from future books for ideas and to reattach in whichever form suits your fancy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","